==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# {{lb|en|physics}} A [[quantum mechanical]] [[phenomenon]] in which the [[quantum state]]s of two or more [[object]]s have to be described with [[reference]] to each other, even though the individual objects are spatially separated.

